<rss version="2.0" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/"><channel><title>财富|财富</title><link>https://fortune.com</link><description>财富 500 强日报和突发商业新闻</description><lastBuildDate>Fri, 02 Oct 2026 02:54:47 GMT</lastBuildDate><generator>rfeed v1.1.1</generator><docs>https://github.com/svpino/rfeed/blob/master/README.md</docs><item><title>“玩一场危险的游戏”：普京威胁称，如果“俄罗斯联邦受到直接攻击”，他将使用“所有武器库”</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/10/01/putin-threatens-retaliation-direct-attack-russia/</link><description>普京在外交政策论坛上发表讲话时指责西方和欧洲的紧张局势升级。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/GettyImages-2297509944.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 02 Oct 2026 00:18:34 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/10/01/putin-threatens-retaliation-direct-attack-russia/</guid></item><item><title>人工智能在受监管行业中的应用：美国银行和标准普尔关于可获取的巨大收益以及涌入的风险</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/10/01/ai-regulated-industries-bank-of-america-sp-global/</link><description>在《财富》杂志的 AIQ 峰会上，美国银行的 Hari Gopalkrishnan 表示，企业太早接触人工智能了。标准普尔全球公司的莎莉·摩尔表示，真正的问题是重塑。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/55563689899_8028688390_3k.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 01 Oct 2026 23:36:06 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/10/01/ai-regulated-industries-bank-of-america-sp-global/</guid></item><item><title>财富 500 强企业首席人力官表示，人工智能已经杀死了组织结构图，想要蓬勃发展的员工需要“忘记”</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/10/01/fortune-aiq-summit-executives-hpe-palo-alto-networks-lennar-workforce-org-charts/</link><description>在《财富》杂志首届 AIQ 峰会上，来自 Palo Alto Networks、HPE 和 Lennar 的高管讨论了人工智能如何重塑企业及其员工。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/55563520728_b9cc959d40_o-e1790887480827.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 01 Oct 2026 22:08:35 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/10/01/fortune-aiq-summit-executives-hpe-palo-alto-networks-lennar-workforce-org-charts/</guid></item><item><title>花旗集团将比特币一年期预测上调至 113,000 美元</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/10/01/citigroup-one-year-bitcoin-forecast-113000/</link><description>该投资银行的一份新报告称，投资者需求的复苏可能会推高加密货币价格。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/GettyImages-932730048-e1790877653462.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 01 Oct 2026 18:02:27 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/10/01/citigroup-one-year-bitcoin-forecast-113000/</guid></item><item><title>派拉蒙承诺每年推出 30 部电影来赢得华纳兄弟。即使米拉麦克斯失败，它也不会害怕</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/10/01/paramount-warner-brothers-miramax-merger-penalty/</link><description>周三，一名联邦法官签署了该协议。每部电影 3000 万美元的罚款比米拉麦克斯的最后通牒更重要。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/GettyImages-77802460.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 01 Oct 2026 17:54:56 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/10/01/paramount-warner-brothers-miramax-merger-penalty/</guid></item><item><title>福特的吉姆·法利：许多工作“肯定会被改变和消除”，但蓝领行业将使用人工智能作为“伴侣”</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/30/ford-ceo-jim-farley-ai-impact-jobs-blue-collar-companion/</link><description>“如果你在财务部门工作，做电子表格，或者你在呼叫中心工作，或者你是一名入门级程序员，那么这些工作肯定会发生变化。” &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Accelerate-2026_Reality-Check_The-State-of-the-Essential-Economy_03-e1790888397122.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Wed, 30 Sep 2026 22:28:38 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/30/ford-ceo-jim-farley-ai-impact-jobs-blue-collar-companion/</guid></item><item><title>窃贼偷走了一辆 Nvidia 品牌的卡车，里面装满了 20,000 磅沙子，这表明大型科技公司价值 1.5 亿美元的人工智能硬件失窃令人头疼</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/10/01/nvidia-branded-truck-20000-pounds-sand-stolen-ai-cargo-theft-plusai/</link><description>虽然盗贼们毫发无损地离开了装满沙子的拖车，但其他货轮却面临着有组织犯罪分子寻找高价值数据中心设备的真正威胁。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/GettyImages-870775614-e1790863896545.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 01 Oct 2026 17:03:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/10/01/nvidia-branded-truck-20000-pounds-sand-stolen-ai-cargo-theft-plusai/</guid></item><item><title>“他们发明了它，这太疯狂了”：Nate Bargatze 谈技术行业的光明未来、现场体验的紧迫性以及人工智能的到来</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/30/nate-bargatze-ai-skilled-trades/</link><description>“以前，当你必须用谷歌搜索某些东西时，就像是一篇又一篇的文章。你会说，‘我不会读这些文章，伙计。’” &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Accelerate-2026_Nate-Bargatze_09-e1790888174576.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Wed, 30 Sep 2026 20:01:55 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/30/nate-bargatze-ai-skilled-trades/</guid></item><item><title>SpaceX 将 4 名宇航员送往国际空间站，历时 8 小时，创纪录</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/10/01/spacex-crew-13-fastest-iss-flight/</link><description>Crew-13 宇航员将在轨道上呆六个月，杰西卡·沃特金斯 (Jessica Watkins) 成为第一位领导宇航员的黑人女性。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/AP26274460402943-e1790887854390.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 01 Oct 2026 20:54:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/10/01/spacex-crew-13-fastest-iss-flight/</guid></item><item><title>“他们将受到非常沉重的打击”：在对伊朗进行警告袭击后，特朗普向中东派遣了大约 9,000 名士兵和第三艘航空母舰</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/10/01/trump-9000-troops-third-aircraft-carrier-middle-east-iran-strike/</link><description>特朗普威胁称，中期选举后的升级仍然是一个可行的选择，尽管他最初向美国人承诺竞选活动将持续几周。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/AP26274608484507-e1790887918529.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 01 Oct 2026 20:53:55 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/10/01/trump-9000-troops-third-aircraft-carrier-middle-east-iran-strike/</guid></item></channel></rss>